{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 strace 跟踪 ssh/sshd 以截获口令。对应需求：口令嗅探。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux用strace抓取SSH口令","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nstrace 附加到 ssh 相关进程。\n\n### 为何重要\n明文口令可能出现在 ptrace 输出。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://github.com/braindead-sec/ssh-grabber","https://dfir.ch/posts/strace/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"9eaa3fb1-3f70-48ed-bb0e-d7ae4d3c8f28","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 口令抓取"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id with maxspan=3s\n  [process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"end\" and process.name == \"sshd\"]\n  [process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action == \"exec\" and process.name == \"strace\"]\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1056","name":"Input Capture","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1056/"},{"id":"T1556","name":"Modify Authentication Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1556/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1554","name":"Compromise Host Software Binary","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1554/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.n